  - H1: 32px / 700 / 1.2 / -0.01em
  - H2: 22px / 700 / 1.3 / -0.005em
  - H3: 16px / 600 / 1.4 / 0
  - Body Large: 16px / 400 / 1.5 / 0
  - Body: 14px / 400 / 1.45 / 0
  - Body Small: 12px / 500 / 1.4 / 0.005em
  - Caption: 10px / 700 / 1.2 / 0.16em uppercase (품질 배지)

